  "notes": "Warm paper/cream palette with a deep forest-green header and accents; document types are colour-coded (parts list brown, service manual blue, wiring diagram purple, user manual grey) via square icon tiles and coloured uppercase eyebrows. Model numbers shown as monospace beige chips. Scan quality pills (green 'Good scan', amber '⚠ Faded', red '⚠ 2 pages missing'). Two-field search splits item from fault; hint teaches a '?' wildcard for unreadable digits. Typing a query reorders results to 'Best match' and swaps right rail to 'Repairs on this item' with expanded notes and an 'Add the fault' prompt; Open swaps the whole page to an in-app page-by-page document viewer (Back to results, page grid, darken text, zoom, print). Live session context (date, venue, volunteers in, current volunteer/table, 'Here today · Table 3') ties the library to the physical repair café."
